# Widgets diagnostic (docs/widgets-spec.md section 6), wchk=1 FIRST in the boot-args. Silent: no touch, no sound. Picture by fbshot_at (the display reports only while it swaps: use 140).
# rwtouch starts ~22 s here: w1 ~117 s, CPU 137-157 s, w3 ~158 s, CPU 185-205 s.
/redwood/bin/rwtouch ifarg wchk=1 say wstart wait 95 notify com.redwood.widgets say w1
/redwood/bin/tolog /redwood/bin/psgrep chronod Widget pkd
/redwood/bin/rwtouch ifarg wchk=1 notify com.redwood.widgets say w2 wait 3
/redwood/bin/tolog /redwood/bin/psgrep -cpu 20
/redwood/bin/rwtouch ifarg wchk=1 notify com.redwood.widgets say w3 wait 25 say w4
/redwood/bin/tolog /redwood/bin/psgrep -cpu 20
/redwood/bin/rwtouch ifarg wchk=1 notify com.redwood.widgets say w5 wait 2 say end
